    {
      "post_id": "581132461960249344",
      "text": "Doomed Germanwings co-pilot 'suffered burnout or depression' years before crash http://t.co/nkqWoRwKUK http://t.co/QRMJTWGAIr",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 16:35:50 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581211609323970561",
      "text": "I see... Do you have a theory about Jörg Haider's VW Phaeton crash? Mine is that his mind went berserk @g_kearnan @DailyMirror.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:50:20 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812095278041211e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581181763638169601",
      "text": "@DailyMirror burnout has a different meaning in German. We would say nervous breakdown",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 19:51:44 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811324619602493e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581203985014661120",
      "text": "Your opinion is totally emotive, illogical and irrational @jopel69 @DailyMirror. I have no opinion about this. I just ponder the facts.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:20:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812032296917729e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581205358355591169",
      "text": "...which is absolutely no proof that you're intelligent at all, of course @g_kearnan @DailyMirror.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:25:30 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812052118191718e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581218914023141377",
      "text": "@Soultrexon cheers",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 22:19:22 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812184669648527e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581207010601000961",
      "text": "Haha. In the sense of \"split\", right @g_kearnan @DailyMirror? But you're in Scotland, right? It's the German meaning that's relevant.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:32:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812043692548178e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581203055334547457",
      "text": "You'd have to ask that to the mom of the ex-classmate @parMaster @DailyMirror. I bet they'd come up with a theory.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:16:21 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811558887587267e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581209527804121088",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror nope. Im in austria...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:42:04 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.81207010601001e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581203229691772928",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror ur entitled to ur opinion as I am entitled to mine! And mine says evil nasty man!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:17:02 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812027947298611e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581137405186478080",
      "text": "so sad !!!  if u wanna kill ur self,  then that's YOUR CHOICE,  but why take innocent ppl with u.  IJS @DailyMirror @AHammond_WREG3",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 16:55:29 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811324619602493e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581217477998313472",
      "text": "@Soultrexon if you like opera and coffee... And it's pretty much crime free.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 22:13:39 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812156657150444e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581205211819171840",
      "text": "Ok. A Scot? You're inoffensive and statistically not likely to blow a fuse over a caricature for dumb minds @g_kearnan @DailyMirror.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:24:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812039009607721e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581202794729861120",
      "text": "Depressive, as per the mom of one of his ex-classmate from long time ago @jopel69 @DailyMirror. Not evil. Your response is irrational.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:15:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811357714003067e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581203900960772096",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror I'm a Scot who's lived in Austria for 10 years...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:19:42 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.81203388483924e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581212321474826240",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror you have no idea how personally popular he was here. The adulation.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:53:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812116093239706e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581205816235167744",
      "text": "Absolutely, @jopel69. And quite a huge diversity of sicknesses, all coming at you in a full palette of colours, scents, essences and forms!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:27:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812051705598403e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581136811944087552",
      "text": "@DailyMirror @KenyanTraffic Why do these depressed people try to take out others at the same time?  A planeload or a family?  Its demonic.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 16:53:07 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811324619602493e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581213713631428608",
      "text": "Could be @g_kearnan @DailyMirror. I knew him only through hearsays.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:58:42 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812129790619853e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581212643173773312",
      "text": "Can I ask you a perhaps indiscreet question @g_kearnan @DailyMirror? What did you think of him at that time?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:54:27 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.81211996210774e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581155888758726656",
      "text": "@DailyMirror didn't you hear the n-word on the cockpit voice records?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 18:08:55 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811324619602493e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581210051085492225",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror more in terms of.. \"sectioned under the mental health act\"...  Rubber wallpaper time...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:44:09 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.81207010601001e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581206289117810688",
      "text": "Why do you believe I care, @jopel69? Are you so arrogant and cocksure as to think you can read my mind?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:29:12 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812043675099873e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581214931946717184",
      "text": "@Soultrexon don't recall hearing that but his party seems to have moved its focus to Vienna...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 22:03:32 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812141410603663e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581213030568095745",
      "text": "I have an idea @g_kearnan @DailyMirror. I had an Austrian girlfriend back then.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:55:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812123214748262e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581214141060366336",
      "text": "Exact @g_kearnan. And nicknamed the Lone Wolf there, isn't it?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 22:00:24 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.81213533045674e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581203388483923969",
      "text": "That answer is more intelligent than the whole Daily Mirror article, @g_kearnan @DailyMirror. We?  You're German? Highly suspicious!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:17:40 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811817636381696e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581135771400306689",
      "text": "@DailyMirror if u want to commit suicide that's ur choice but all those poor innocent people/children &amp; babies had NO choice! Evil person 😡",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 16:48:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811324619602493e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581212979061985281",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror he was clever and charismatic and he was screwed over by the leader of the conservatives.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:55:47 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812126431737733e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581213533045673984",
      "text": "@Soultrexon he was governor of carinthia, a province notorious for it's protection of old Nazis...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:57:59 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812126431737733e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581218466964852736",
      "text": "3 things I do appreciate indeed @g_kearnan. Gotta go. Happy trails!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 22:17:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812174779983135e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581205170559840256",
      "text": "@Soultrexon there's some sick people in this world 😡👊",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:24:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812032296917729e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581202047581732865",
      "text": "I see, @DailyMirror. I suppose the mother of this ex-classmate is an extremely reliable source, and her daughter too? Your post is baloney.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:12:21 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.811324619602493e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581204369254817792",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror often \"burnout\" here means \"sectioned\"",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:21:34 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.81203388483924e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581204367509987328",
      "text": "@Soultrexon why do u care? I don't care for ur opinion or facts! I say what I say end of!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:21:34 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812039850146611e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581211996210774016",
      "text": "@Soultrexon @DailyMirror funnily enough I met him a few days before... In a Salzburg beer hall...",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 21:51:52 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812116093239706e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "581215665715044352",
      "text": "Vienna. I heard so much about this city @g_kearnan. I'll have to go see it by myself with my own eyes very soon!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Mar 26 22:06:27 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.812149319467172e+17,
